                            <comment id="17552137" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Thu, 9 Jun 2022 11:28:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Root cause:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Thin JDBC driver handles BinaryObjectException invalid: closes connection.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proposal fix:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
    Do nothing with defaults keepBinary mode,&lt;br/&gt;
    Handles BinaryObjectException properly.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
